  "onboardingSlide1Title": "One record per animal",
  "onboardingSlide1Body": "A dog or a cat, its breed, its birth date and where it came from. The first one takes under a minute.",
  "onboardingSlide2Title": "Its health, in order",
  "onboardingSlide2Body": "Vaccinations with their next due date, weigh-ins, screenings and vet visits. Companion books the reminder for you.",
  "onboardingSlide3Title": "Its story travels with it",
  "onboardingSlide3Body": "A PDF or a spreadsheet for the buyer, and one ZIP that carries every record and picture to a new phone.",
